2. **§5 Placement Error Taxonomy / §10 Test Plan:** the sample error object includes `allowed`, `retry_after_seconds`, and `trace_id` as nullable fields, but the rules say those fields are present only for specific codes.
Action: choose one stable contract, either omit non-applicable optional fields or always include nullable fields, then update the sample and tests.

